# build context of the webapps image (the repo root): only the web apps folder and the dbt project go in, whatever the
# file type. paths are relative to the repo root, not to this file
*
!src/webapps
!DataWarehouseDbt

# written by python on Windows
**/__pycache__

# written by dbt on Windows, as in the dbt image: the image runs dbt deps itself, target/ and logs/ are written at run time
DataWarehouseDbt/target
DataWarehouseDbt/logs
DataWarehouseDbt/dbt_packages
